OL,3,APatients in chains rescued from
OL,4,Asuspected illegal rehab centre in South
OL,5,AAfrica
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pastor and his wife have been
OL,8,Farrested in South Africa after 200
OL,9,Fpeople, some in chains, were found held
OL,10,Fat a suspected illegal rehabilitation
OL,11,Fcentre in the north-eastern part of the
OL,12,Fcountry.
OL,14,FThe facility, operated from a church in
OL,15,FMpumalanga province, was discovered
OL,16,Fduring an operation by officials in the
OL,17,Farea on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
