OL,3,APatients in chains rescued from
OL,4,Asuspected illegal rehab centre in South
OL,5,AAfrica
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities said they uncovered "gross
OL,8,Finhumane conditions" when they raided
OL,9,Fthe facility, with some patients found
OL,10,Fwith "sores all over their bodies" and
OL,11,F"others chained to each other".
OL,13,FPolice have since charged the couple,
OL,14,Fwho were running the facility, with
OL,15,Fkidnapping but could add more charges.
OL,16,FThey have not yet commented.
